<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21694" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γαῦρ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>exulting in</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βοστρύχοισι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Archil.
					58
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄλβῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					862
				</span></i>
			: abs., <i>haughty, disdainful</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				788
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ra.</u>
				282
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γ. καὶ μετέωρος</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Nigr.</u>
				5
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Caes.</u>
				319d
			</span></i>; in good sense, <i>splendid</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.Chr.
				67.5
			</span></i> (
				Comp.
			), <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				68.31
			</span></i>; epith. of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔφηβοι</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				7.544
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				545
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Tanagra</span>); also, <i>skittish</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μόσχω γαυροτέρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					11.21
				</span></i>
			: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ γ.,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γαυρότης, τὸ γ. ἐν φρεσὶν
					κεκτημένοι</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				217
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ γαῦρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Babr.
					43.6
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			
				Sup.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γαυρότατα, εἰπεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Max.
				</span></i>
			 Tyr.<i><span class="en">
				7.7
			</span></i>. (Cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γαίω.</span>)</div>
